WEBVTT

00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:02.007
What versus why.

00:00:02.057 --> 00:00:05.533
Behavioural data from sales and dashboards shows what happened.

00:00:05.583 --> 00:00:11.338
Qualitative research uncovers why, by talking, watching and following people over time.

00:00:12.033 --> 00:00:14.306
A shopper says she wants something cheaper.

00:00:14.356 --> 00:00:18.623
Keep asking why, and the real driver turns out to be saving time.

00:00:19.333 --> 00:00:22.066
Estelle's team put body cameras on baristas.

00:00:22.116 --> 00:00:26.643
Watching the footage surfaced carton problems nobody had mentioned when asked.

00:00:27.333 --> 00:00:28.509
Use it like this:

00:00:28.559 --> 00:00:29.359
name the what the client already has,

00:00:28.866 --> 00:00:34.179
then pick two or three qualitative methods to find the why.
